        },
        {
          "description": "Origin: Ministère de la Santé et de la Protection Sociale, Kingdom of Morocco, Santé en Chiffres (editions 2019, 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024). Tables were extracted from the PDF reports with scripted parsers (position-based column matching for tables where blank cells stand for zero), then province names and region spellings were harmonised.",
